WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:09.000
My tasks is your to-do list from the centre: things like a form to return, a document to send, or a payment to arrange.

2
00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:13.990
Tap a task to see what's needed and open the right screen to do it.

3
00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:21.120
The open tasks card on your home screen tells you how many are waiting, so nothing slips through the cracks.
